Modified for the Zellij Spaces plugin: the evaluator was trimmed to bundled
manifests, regions, gates, priorities and visible/skip flags. Remote manifest
loading, overrides, diagnostics, and filesystem/update machinery were removed.
The TOML manifests are copied verbatim and converted to `manifests.json` by
`scripts/sync-screen-manifests.py`.
